  "editorial": "len(text) counts code points. UTF-8 uses one byte for ASCII and more for many other characters. The size on the wire or in a file is the encoded length. Encoding does not modify the str you still hold.",
  "reference_solution": "def solve(text):\n    return len(text.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n"
